{
  "id": 8867179692231,
  "title": "Personalized Baseball Bedding Full Size Flag Custom Name D - Design 11",
  "handle": "personalized-baseball-bedding-full-size-flag-custom-name-d-design-11",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a celebration of America's favorite pastime with this personalized baseball bedding set from Jeminise. Perfect for baseball players and fans alike, this comforter set offers comfort, durability, and a unique way to display your passion for the game, making it an ideal gift for men, women, moms, and dads on special occasions.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> Celebrate baseball enthusiasts with a thoughtful gift for men and women, moms and dads, perfect for Valentine's, Mother's, Father's Day, and Christmas.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\") to fit various bed dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing Process:</strong> Environmentally friendly finishing techniques ensure the fabric retains dye, preventing fading, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching for lasting enjoyment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric for a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight feel, with whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and can be air-dried without heat; microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier after washing. For best results, wash in a mesh laundry bag.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features a customizable baseball theme with US Flag elements, allowing for two text inputs to add a personal touch.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber Filling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Design</th>\n<td>Personalized Baseball Bedding Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Closure Type</th>\n<td>Zipper</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Quantity</th>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
